// The narrowing check (N2, A:1362; plan d.11): a reference recorded against a
// fact that is a writer by N3 (here passed to a `let` parameter) may break the
// fact, so the narrowed use after it is EN0401; passed to a Read parameter it
// breaks nothing; a new test after the write makes the use good again.
